---
---Controls whether the technology cost ignores the tech cost multiplier set in the [DifficultySettings](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/concepts/DifficultySettings.html). E.g. `4` for the default expensive difficulty.
---
---[View Documentation](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/TechnologyPrototype.html%23ignore_tech_cost_multiplier#ignore_tech_cost_multiplier)
---@field ignore_tech_cost_multiplier? boolean
---@
---
---`"infinite"` for infinite technologies, otherwise `uint32`.
---
---Defaults to the same level as the technology, which is `0` for non-upgrades, and the level of the upgrade for upgrades.
